## Original Content
O ministro dos Negócios Estrangeiros diz que só a AD, com a sua moderação pode governar o País, já que o PS é sinónimo de "laxismo" e "deixa-andar-a-ver-se dá" e Chega de "demagogia e mentira".

## Summary
Portuguese Foreign Affairs Minister Rangel criticizes the PS party for being synonymous with laxity and the Chega party for demagoguery and lies, asserting only the AD (Democratic Alliance) can effectively govern the country due to its moderation.

## Key Points
- Minister Rangel critiques PS for laxity
- Chega party accused of demagoguery and lies
- AD praised for moderation as the only viable governing option


